OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day for many with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of light rain and drizzle at
OL,7,Ftimes, especially over western hills.
OL,8,FHowever, it will be drier with some
OL,9,Fbrighter spells developing in some
OL,10,Fsheltered eastern areas. Windy at
OL,11,Ffirst, gradually easing. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying cloudy with further
OL,14,Foutbreaks of light rain and drizzle at
OL,15,Ftimes, more persistent on western
OL,16,Ffacing hills. Occasional drier
OL,17,Finterludes in the east. Light winds.
OL,18,FMild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
