OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy and damp start, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of light rain and drizzle,
OL,7,Fespecially on western hills. Rain
OL,8,Fgradually easing from the north
OL,9,Fthrough the evening. Light winds.
OL,10,FTemperatures near average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FEarly
OL,13,Frain clearing southeast to give dry
OL,14,Fand bright conditions Wednesday.
OL,15,FMostly dry with sunny spells Thursday,
OL,16,Fafter a chilly start. Breezier, with
OL,17,Frain spreading east Friday.
OL,18,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
